### 1. Health checks
GET http://localhost:3000/health

GET http://localhost:3001/health

GET http://localhost:3002/health

### 2. Product Service (Port 3001)

### Create a product
POST http://localhost:3001/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nike Airforce",
  "description": "Premium Casual shoes",
  "price": 2999,
  "stock": 10
}

### Get all products
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products

### Get one product
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products/6addbbb493dd72ed021a6a30

### Update product
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/products/6addbbb493dd72ed021a6a30
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 9999
}

### Delete product
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/products/6addbbb493dd72ed021a6a30


### 3. Inventory Service (Port 3002)

### Initialize inventory for a product
POST http://localhost:3002/api/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "6addbbb493dd72ed021a6a30",
  "sku": "NIKE-AIR-001",
  "stock": 50,
  "reserved": 0,
  "location": "Warehouse-North"
}

### List all inventory
GET http://localhost:3002/api/inventory

### Get inventory by inventory ID or Product ID
GET http://localhost:3002/api/inventory/6addbbb493dd72ed021a6a30

### Update inventory stock
PATCH http://localhost:3002/api/inventory/6addbbb493dd72ed021a6a30
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": 100,
  "reserved": 5
}

### Delete inventory
DELETE http://localhost:3002/api/inventory/6addbbb493dd72ed021a6a30


### 4. Order Service (Port 3000)

### Create an order
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Test Customer",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "6addbbb493dd72ed021a6a30",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### List orders
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders

### Get one order
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders/6addbc2493dd72ed021a6a32

### Update order status
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/orders/6addbc2493dd72ed021a6a32/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "cancelled"
}
